    lead: ['物理化学用物理的方法回答化学的问题。热力学告诉我们一个过程能不能自发、平衡在哪里，但不管多快；动力学研究速率和机理；统计力学把两者和分子的能级、运动连起来；量子力学给出能级本身。本馆八章依次讲气体、热力学三定律、化学平衡、溶液和相平衡、化学动力学、统计热力学、表面与催化，最后一章讲远离平衡的热力学和飞秒尺度上“看”反应发生。', 'Physical chemistry answers chemical questions with the methods of physics. Thermodynamics says whether a process can happen spontaneously and where equilibrium lies, but not how fast; kinetics studies rates and mechanisms; statistical mechanics connects both to the energy levels and motions of molecules; quantum mechanics supplies the levels themselves. The eight chapters cover gases, the laws of thermodynamics, chemical equilibrium, solutions and phase equilibria, kinetics, statistical thermodynamics and surfaces and catalysis, and finish with thermodynamics far from equilibrium and watching reactions on the femtosecond scale.'],
